{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"chengguo-e-o054a","title":"董昭计露孙权书曹操令徐晃射围中","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-b1c38e8e300082bef721","label":"正文","text":"董昭计露孙权书曹操令徐晃射围中","evidence":["chengguo-q-b642988dd32aa194114e"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0122","role":"计露权书","evidence":["chengguo-q-b642988dd32aa194114e"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"令徐晃射书","evidence":["chengguo-q-b642988dd32aa194114e"]},{"person":"wudi-p0180","role":"受令射书","evidence":["chengguo-q-b642988dd32aa194114e"]},{"person":"wudi-p0172","role":"闻书犹豫","evidence":["chengguo-q-b642988dd32aa194114e"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文","precision":"undated","basis":"拆分行动分别核对；无本条直接释年，不承袭复合候选公元年。","evidence":["chengguo-q-b642988dd32aa194114e"]},"ordering_evidence":"chengguo-q-b642988dd32aa194114e","source_order":[14,214,70],"order":3062}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0122","name":"董昭","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0172","name":"关羽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0180","name":"徐晃","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-b642988dd32aa194114e","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-ffe3df8382e2c02cd193","layer":"original","quote":"太祖诘群臣，群臣咸言宜当密之。昭曰：“军事尚权〖12〗，期于合宜。宜应权以密，而内露之：羽闻权上，若还自护，围则速解，便获其利；可使两贼相对衔持，坐待其弊。秘而不露，使权得志，非计之上。又围中将吏不知有救，计粮怖惧〖13〗；傥有他意〖14〗，为难不小。露之为便〖15〗。且羽，为人强梁〖16〗，自恃二城守固，必不速退。”太祖曰：“善！”即敕救将徐晃：以权书射著围里及羽屯中。围里闻之，志气百倍；羽果犹豫。","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":213,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":70,"end":272}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
